{
  "fps": 30,
  "width": 1920,
  "height": 1080,
  "totalFrames": 6630,
  "totalSeconds": 221,
  "estimated": false,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "name": "ColdOpen",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 390,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L01",
          "text": "Every hero has an origin story.",
          "start": 83,
          "duration": 61,
          "startS": 2.773,
          "durationS": 2.02,
          "globalStart": 83
        },
        {
          "id": "L02",
          "text": "Ours begins with an idea, and a *curve*.",
          "start": 199,
          "duration": 72,
          "startS": 6.638,
          "durationS": 2.39,
          "globalStart": 199
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "name": "FlatLine",
      "start": 390,
      "duration": 450,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L03",
          "text": "For almost all of human history, progress crawled.",
          "start": 71,
          "duration": 85,
          "startS": 2.38,
          "durationS": 2.83,
          "globalStart": 461
        },
        {
          "id": "L04",
          "text": "Writing. The printing press. Electricity. The computer. Each took generations to reshape the world.",
          "start": 200,
          "duration": 200,
          "startS": 6.67,
          "durationS": 6.65,
          "globalStart": 590
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "name": "Attention",
      "start": 840,
      "duration": 570,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L05",
          "text": "Then, in 2017, eight researchers at Google published a paper with an unusual title.",
          "start": 34,
          "duration": 183,
          "startS": 1.14,
          "durationS": 6.11,
          "globalStart": 874
        },
        {
          "id": "L06",
          "text": "*Attention* Is All You Need.",
          "start": 249,
          "duration": 45,
          "startS": 8.29,
          "durationS": 1.49,
          "globalStart": 1089
        },
        {
          "id": "L07",
          "text": "It let a machine weigh every word against every other word, all at once. They called it the Transformer.",
          "start": 331,
          "duration": 181,
          "startS": 11.02,
          "durationS": 6.04,
          "globalStart": 1171
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "name": "Scale",
      "start": 1410,
      "duration": 540,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L08",
          "text": "Then came a discovery. Make the models bigger. Give them more data, more compute. And new abilities emerge.",
          "start": 37,
          "duration": 203,
          "startS": 1.217,
          "durationS": 6.78,
          "globalStart": 1447
        },
        {
          "id": "L09",
          "text": "The compute used to train frontier AI has grown four to five times every year, for more than a decade.",
          "start": 295,
          "duration": 191,
          "startS": 9.832,
          "durationS": 6.35,
          "globalStart": 1705
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "name": "HeroBorn",
      "start": 1950,
      "duration": 810,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L10",
          "text": "In 2021, a small team founded Anthropic, with a simple conviction.",
          "start": 62,
          "duration": 153,
          "startS": 2.05,
          "durationS": 5.11,
          "globalStart": 2012
        },
        {
          "id": "L11",
          "text": "If this was going to be the most powerful technology in history, it had to be built *safely*.",
          "start": 230,
          "duration": 154,
          "startS": 7.66,
          "durationS": 5.14,
          "globalStart": 2180
        },
        {
          "id": "L12",
          "text": "So they gave their creation something new: a constitution. Principles to be helpful, honest, and harmless.",
          "start": 411,
          "duration": 200,
          "startS": 13.7,
          "durationS": 6.66,
          "globalStart": 2361
        },
        {
          "id": "L13",
          "text": "In March 2023, the world met *Claude*.",
          "start": 641,
          "duration": 87,
          "startS": 21.36,
          "durationS": 2.89,
          "globalStart": 2591
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "name": "Powers",
      "start": 2760,
      "duration": 690,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L14",
          "text": "And like every hero, it grew *stronger*.",
          "start": 45,
          "duration": 66,
          "startS": 1.492,
          "durationS": 2.2,
          "globalStart": 2805
        },
        {
          "id": "L15",
          "text": "It learned to read a whole novel in seconds. To see. To write code. To use a computer. To work for hours on its own.",
          "start": 144,
          "duration": 229,
          "startS": 4.785,
          "durationS": 7.64,
          "globalStart": 2904
        },
        {
          "id": "L16",
          "text": "The length of tasks AI can complete on its own has doubled roughly every seven months. Lately, even *faster*.",
          "start": 412,
          "duration": 216,
          "startS": 13.718,
          "durationS": 7.19,
          "globalStart": 3172
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "name": "Enemies",
      "start": 3450,
      "duration": 420,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L17",
          "text": "But a hero is defined by the battles it *chooses*.",
          "start": 64,
          "duration": 89,
          "startS": 2.122,
          "durationS": 2.98,
          "globalStart": 3514
        },
        {
          "id": "L18",
          "text": "And humanity's oldest enemies were still waiting. Disease. Ignorance. Poverty. A warming planet.",
          "start": 184,
          "duration": 199,
          "startS": 6.147,
          "durationS": 6.63,
          "globalStart": 3634
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "name": "Battles",
      "start": 3870,
      "duration": 1020,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L19",
          "text": "Against disease, Claude is helping scientists decode the machinery of life, and even discover new biology.",
          "start": 48,
          "duration": 198,
          "startS": 1.598,
          "durationS": 6.6,
          "globalStart": 3918
        },
        {
          "id": "L20",
          "text": "Against ignorance, a patient tutor for every curious mind. At any hour, in their own language.",
          "start": 292,
          "duration": 178,
          "startS": 9.729,
          "durationS": 5.94,
          "globalStart": 4162
        },
        {
          "id": "L21",
          "text": "Against poverty, the kind of expert help once reserved for the few, within reach of anyone who asks.",
          "start": 516,
          "duration": 185,
          "startS": 17.201,
          "durationS": 6.16,
          "globalStart": 4386
        },
        {
          "id": "L22",
          "text": "And for our planet, new tools to discover better materials, cleaner energy, and smarter ways to use what we have.",
          "start": 747,
          "duration": 210,
          "startS": 24.892,
          "durationS": 7.01,
          "globalStart": 4617
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "name": "Exponential",
      "start": 4890,
      "duration": 630,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L23",
          "text": "And now, the curve is bending *upward*.",
          "start": 99,
          "duration": 66,
          "startS": 3.295,
          "durationS": 2.19,
          "globalStart": 4989
        },
        {
          "id": "L24",
          "text": "Imagine a country of geniuses in a datacenter. Working not against us, but *for* us.",
          "start": 230,
          "duration": 157,
          "startS": 7.68,
          "durationS": 5.22,
          "globalStart": 5120
        },
        {
          "id": "L25",
          "text": "Decades of scientific progress, compressed into *years*.",
          "start": 450,
          "duration": 96,
          "startS": 14.995,
          "durationS": 3.21,
          "globalStart": 5340
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "name": "Finale",
      "start": 5520,
      "duration": 630,
      "letterbox": 0,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L26",
          "text": "Power was never the hardest part. The hardest part is choosing to use it *for good*.",
          "start": 63,
          "duration": 142,
          "startS": 2.103,
          "durationS": 4.72,
          "globalStart": 5583
        },
        {
          "id": "L27",
          "text": "That is what makes a *hero*.",
          "start": 271,
          "duration": 43,
          "startS": 9.025,
          "durationS": 1.42,
          "globalStart": 5791
        },
        {
          "id": "L28",
          "text": "And this story is only just *beginning*.",
          "start": 382,
          "duration": 59,
          "startS": 12.748,
          "durationS": 1.95,
          "globalStart": 5902
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "name": "Credits",
      "start": 6150,
      "duration": 480,
      "letterbox": 0,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L29",
          "text": "Every frame you just watched was written in code, by *Claude*.",
          "start": 36,
          "duration": 96,
          "startS": 1.196,
          "durationS": 3.21,
          "globalStart": 6186
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}